<!-- LAGNAM -->
<section class="lagnam-section">
  <div class="section-label">What is Lagnam?</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Your Ascendant —<br/>your <em>outer expression</em></h2>
  <div class="lagnam-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="lagnam-desc">If your Raasi is your inner world, your <strong>Lagnam</strong> (Ascendant) is your outer mask — the version of you that the world sees first. It governs your physical appearance, personality, how you approach challenges, and the lens through which you experience life.</p>
      <p class="lagnam-desc">Your Lagnam is determined by which zodiac sign was rising on the eastern horizon at the exact moment and location of your birth. Unlike Raasi, which changes roughly every 2.5 days, the Lagnam changes every 2 hours — making it one of the most precise and personal indicators in Vedic astrology.</p>
      <p class="lagnam-desc">Two people with the same Raasi but different Lagnams will live very different lives. One might be extroverted and action-oriented (Mesham Lagnam), while the other is introspective and cautious (Magaram Lagnam) — even though both share the same emotional blueprint.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lagnam-importance">
      <div class="lagnam-imp-title">Why Lagnam Matters</div>
      <ul class="lagnam-points">
        <li>Your Lagnam determines the layout of your entire birth chart — which planets sit in which houses of your life (career, relationships, health, etc.).</li>
        <li>It shapes how you approach the world: boldly, cautiously, analytically, emotionally, diplomatically.</li>
        <li>Lagnam governs your physical constitution and vitality — your natural energy levels and health tendencies.</li>
        <li>Together with Raasi and Nakshatra, it creates your unique astrological fingerprint — no two charts are the same.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- NAKSHATRA -->
<section class="nakshatra-section">
  <div class="nakshatra-intro">
    <div class="section-label" style="color:rgba(200,148,26,0.7);">What is Nakshatra?</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color:var(--cream); font-weight:300;">Your Birth Star —<br/>your <em style="color:var(--gold-light)">karmic blueprint</em></h2>
    <p style="font-size:14px; color:rgba(254,250,243,0.5); line-height:1.9; margin-top:16px;">While Raasi and Lagnam are broad strokes, your <strong>Nakshatra</strong> is the fine detail. The 27 Nakshatras divide the zodiac into precise lunar mansions, each ruled by a specific deity and planet. Your Nakshatra reveals your soul's purpose, your deepest nature, and the karmic themes you are here to work through in this lifetime.</p>
    <p style="font-size:14px; color:rgba(254,250,243,0.5); line-height:1.9; margin-top:14px;">Ask Astro Raja uses your Nakshatra as the foundation of every reading — it is the most specific and powerful part of your Vedic chart.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="nak-grid">
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 01</div><div class="nak-name">Ashwini</div><div class="nak-tamil">அஸ்வினி</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Ketu</div><p class="nak-essence">Swift, healing energy. Natural initiators with a restless drive to start new things.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 02</div><div class="nak-name">Bharani</div><div class="nak-tamil">பரணி</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Venus</div><p class="nak-essence">Transformative power. Carries heavy burdens, deeply creative, associated with birth and death.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 03</div><div class="nak-name">Karthikai</div><div class="nak-tamil">கார்த்திகை</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Sun</div><p class="nak-essence">Purifying flame. Cutting through illusion, direct, fiercely protective.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 04</div><div class="nak-name">Rohini</div><div class="nak-tamil">ரோகிணி</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Moon</div><p class="nak-essence">Fertile, sensual, growth-oriented. Deeply attractive and magnetic personality.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 05</div><div class="nak-name">Mrigashira</div><div class="nak-tamil">மிருகசீரிடம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Mars</div><p class="nak-essence">The searching deer. Curious, restless, always seeking something just out of reach.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 06</div><div class="nak-name">Ardra</div><div class="nak-tamil">திருவாதிரை</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Rahu</div><p class="nak-essence">The storm. Intense transformation, destruction before renewal.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 07</div><div class="nak-name">Punarvasu</div><div class="nak-tamil">புனர்பூசம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Jupiter</div><p class="nak-essence">Return of the light. Resilience, optimism, the ability to bounce back.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 08</div><div class="nak-name">Pushya</div><div class="nak-tamil">பூசம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Saturn</div><p class="nak-essence">Nourishing. Supportive, disciplined, deeply devoted to family and tradition.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 09</div><div class="nak-name">Ashlesha</div><div class="nak-tamil">ஆயில்யம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Mercury</div><p class="nak-essence">Serpent energy. Hypnotic, secretive, deeply perceptive.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 10</div><div class="nak-name">Magha</div><div class="nak-tamil">மகம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Ketu</div><p class="nak-essence">Royal lineage. Pride, duty, respect for ancestors and tradition.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 11</div><div class="nak-name">Purva Phalguni</div><div class="nak-tamil">பூரம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Venus</div><p class="nak-essence">Pleasure-seeking. Artistic, sensual, enjoys life's comforts.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 12</div><div class="nak-name">Uttara Phalguni</div><div class="nak-tamil">உத்திரம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Sun</div><p class="nak-essence">Generous leadership. Warm, reliable, takes responsibility for others.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 13</div><div class="nak-name">Hasta</div><div class="nak-tamil">அஸ்தம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Moon</div><p class="nak-essence">Skilled hands. Dexterity, craftsmanship, control over the material world.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 14</div><div class="nak-name">Chitra</div><div class="nak-tamil">சித்திரை</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Mars</div><p class="nak-essence">The jewel. Beauty, design, perfecting form and appearance.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 15</div><div class="nak-name">Swathi</div><div class="nak-tamil">சுவாதி</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Rahu</div><p class="nak-essence">The sword. Independence, flexibility, moves like the wind.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 16</div><div class="nak-name">Vishakha</div><div class="nak-tamil">விசாகம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Jupiter</div><p class="nak-essence">Goal-focused. Ambitious, determined, willing to work for long-term rewards.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 17</div><div class="nak-name">Anuradha</div><div class="nak-tamil">அனுஷம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Saturn</div><p class="nak-essence">Devoted friendship. Loyal, cooperative, thrives in partnerships.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 18</div><div class="nak-name">Jyeshta</div><div class="nak-tamil">கேட்டை</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Mercury</div><p class="nak-essence">The eldest. Authority, protection, can be controlling or possessive.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 19</div><div class="nak-name">Mula</div><div class="nak-tamil">மூலம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Ketu</div><p class="nak-essence">The root. Deep investigation, uproots the false, seeks truth.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 20</div><div class="nak-name">Purva Ashadha</div><div class="nak-tamil">பூராடம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Venus</div><p class="nak-essence">Invincible. Confident, unconquerable spirit, victory-oriented.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 21</div><div class="nak-name">Uttara Ashadha</div><div class="nak-tamil">உத்திராடம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Sun</div><p class="nak-essence">Righteous victory. Patient, principled, ultimate success through integrity.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 22</div><div class="nak-name">Shravana</div><div class="nak-tamil">திருவோணம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Moon</div><p class="nak-essence">The listener. Learning, absorbing knowledge, wise through observation.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 23</div><div class="nak-name">Dhanishta</div><div class="nak-tamil">அவிட்டம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Mars</div><p class="nak-essence">Wealth and rhythm. Musical, prosperous, synchronized with cosmic timing.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 24</div><div class="nak-name">Shatabhisha</div><div class="nak-tamil">சதயம்</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Rahu</div><p class="nak-essence">A hundred healers. Mystery, healing, solitary pursuits.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 25</div><div class="nak-name">Purva Bhadrapada</div><div class="nak-tamil">பூரட்டாதி</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Jupiter</div><p class="nak-essence">The burning pair. Intense, transformative, purification through fire.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 26</div><div class="nak-name">Uttara Bhadrapada</div><div class="nak-tamil">உத்திரட்டாதி</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Saturn</div><p class="nak-essence">The cosmic serpent. Deep wisdom, grounded spirituality, patient endurance.</p></div>
    <div class="nak-card"><div class="nak-num">Nakshatra 27</div><div class="nak-name">Revathi</div><div class="nak-tamil">ரேவதி</div><div class="nak-ruler">Ruled by Mercury</div><p class="nak-essence">The shepherd. Nourishing, guiding, completing cycles, compassionate.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW TO KNOW YOUR DETAILS -->
<section class="know-details-section">
  <div class="section-label">Finding Your Details</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">How to find your<br/><em>Raasi, Lagnam & Nakshatra</em></h2>
  <p class="section-sub">If you already know them from a previous reading or family records, you're ready to begin. If not, here are your options.</p>
  <div class="know-grid">
    <div class="know-card">
      <span class="know-icon">📜</span>
      <h3 class="know-title">Check Family Records</h3>
      <p class="know-body">In Tamil Nadu, many families keep a written record of birth details (Janam Patrika) created by an astrologer at the time of birth. Ask your parents or elders — they may have this document.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="know-card">
      <span class="know-icon">⏰</span>
      <h3 class="know-title">Use a Vedic Calculator</h3>
      <p class="know-body">If you know your exact birth time, date, and location, you can use a free online Vedic astrology calculator to find your Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra. Search for "Vedic birth chart calculator" and enter your details.</p>
      <ul class="know-steps">
        <li>Enter your date of birth</li>
        <li>Enter exact time of birth (if known)</li>
        <li>Enter place of birth (city)</li>
        <li>Select "South Indian" or "Vedic" chart style</li>
        <li>Look for Raasi (Moon Sign), Lagnam (Ascendant), and Nakshatra (Birth Star)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="know-card">
      <span class="know-icon">🏛️</span>
      <h3 class="know-title">Consult a Local Astrologer</h3>
      <p class="know-body">If birth time is unknown, a Vedic astrologer can help determine your Raasi and Nakshatra through rectification methods or by asking a few key life event questions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="know-card">
      <span class="know-icon">❓</span>
      <h3 class="know-title">What If I Don't Know?</h3>
      <p class="know-body">If you absolutely cannot find your Raasi, Lagnam, or Nakshatra, you can still try our tool by selecting "I Don't Know" in the form — but the reading will be less precise. We strongly recommend finding these details first for the best experience.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

